$ enola doctor --help
exit: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
Usage: enola doctor [flags] [repo_path]

Report whether enola's agent hooks are actually firing in this repository.

`install --hooks` can write a configuration the agent ignores — it reports
success either way. This asks the only question that settles it: when did the
hooks last run?

Flags:
  -json
    	machine-readable output
